<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="COL" style="id">- TarifitLS</book>
  <para style="h">Ayṯ-Kulus</para>
  <para style="toc3">Kul</para>
  <para style="toc2">Ayṯ-Kulus</para>
  <para style="toc1">Ṯabrat n arrasul Bulus ɣar Ayṯ-Kulus</para>
  <para style="mt1">Ṯabrat n arrasul Bulus ɣar Ayṯ-Kulus</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="COL 1" />
  <para style="s">Lmuqaddima</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="COL 1:1" />Nec ḏ Bulus ḏ arrasul n Ƹisa Lmasiḥ s ȓxaḍar n Arebbi, akiḏi umaṯneɣ Timutawus. <verse eid="COL 1:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="COL 1:2" /><char style="it">Tariɣ ṯabrat-a</char> i wawmaṯen iy ḏi iǧa lʼiman iǧan ḏ ṣṣaliḥin ḏi ṯendint n Kulus. Akiḏwem yiȓi arḍa ḏ ȓehna zi Arebbi Babaṯneɣ.<verse eid="COL 1:2" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ccuker ḏ ṯẓaǧiṯ n arrasul Bulus x ȓmuminin</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="COL 1:3" />Neccin ȓebda netcekkar Arebbi Babas n Siḏiṯneɣ Ƹisa Lmasiḥ xmi ḏas ntettar xawem. <verse eid="COL 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="COL 1:4" />Liʼanna netsȓa xawem x lʼiman nwem iy ḏaywem x Ƹisa Lmasiḥ ḏ ȓemḥibbeṯ nwem iy teggem i ṣṣaliḥin marra. <verse eid="COL 1:4" /><verse number="5-6" style="v" sid="COL 1:5-6" />Lʼiman-a ḏ ȓemḥibbeṯ-a tasen-d zi lʼamal nni itwaxemmȓen i kenniw ḏeg ujenna. Tuɣa ṯesȓim xas ḏeg wawaȓ n ȓḥaqq iƹni ḏi Lʼinjil iy ɣarwem d yuwḍen. Ḏi marra ddunect-a Lʼinjil-a itarew itemɣar, mamc ƹaweḏ ixeddem jarawem zeg wami iy ḏas ṯesȓim ṯfehmem ḏ ṣṣaḥ arḍa n Arebbi. <verse eid="COL 1:5-6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="COL 1:7" />Amenni iy ṯ ṯȓemḏem zeg <char style="it">wumaṯneɣ</char> Pafras netta ḏ amsexxar iƹizzen ḏi ȓxeḏmeṯ. Ixeddem nican i Lmasiḥ ƹlaḥsab nneɣ. <verse eid="COL 1:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="COL 1:8" />Iƹaweḏ-aneɣ xawem x ȓemḥibbeṯ nwem lʼaṣel n ȓemḥibbeṯ-a ḏ Arruḥ iqeddsen.<verse eid="COL 1:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="COL 1:9" />X manaya zi nhar nni wami tuɣa nesȓa neccin xawem, netɣima ntettar-as i Arebbi xawem bac aḏ tƹemmarem s ṯusna<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1.9 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ṯusna nettaṯ ḏ lmaƹrifa.</char></note> x ȓxaḍar n Arebbi s marra ȓƹaqeȓ ḏ ȓefhameṯ ig iticcen Arruḥ iqeddsen. <verse eid="COL 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="COL 1:10" />Ḥima aḏ tuyurem x yijjen n ubriḏ iy ḏas iticcen i Siḏiṯneɣ lqima iy ḏas iteƹjiben marra. X ubriḏ-a aḏ tarwem marra ȓexḏayem ṯiṣebḥanin aḏ tmarnim ḏi ṯusna nwem x Arebbi. <verse eid="COL 1:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="COL 1:11" /><char style="it">Ntettar i Arebbi</char> aḏ tjehḏem ḏi marra ṯizemmar nwem ƹlaḥsab lquwwa nnes iǧan ƹaḍima bac aḏ tbeddem aḏ teṣbarem mliḥ s ȓefraḥeṯ, <verse eid="COL 1:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="COL 1:12" />bac aḏ tcekkarem Babaṯneɣ wenni iy ḏawem yucin ȓḥaqq aḏ tcarcem ḏi lwareṯ n ṣṣaliḥin ḏi nnur. <verse eid="COL 1:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="COL 1:13" />Isefȓeṯ-aneɣ zi ȓeḥkam n ṯaǧest issiweḍ-aneɣ ɣar ȓmulk n Mmis iƹizzen. <verse eid="COL 1:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="COL 1:14" />Zzayes netta isenjem-aneɣ iƹni iɣfar-aneɣ ȓmuƹṣiyaṯ nneɣ.<verse eid="COL 1:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="COL 1:15" />Mmis netta ḏ ṣṣifeṯ n Arebbi wenni war nzemmar ca neccin aṯ nẓer. Netta ḏ amenzu<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1.15 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Amenzu netta ḏ ifxeddi, qqaren-ṯ i uḥenjir iy d ixeȓqen ḏ amezwaru.</char></note> iḥekkem x qaƹ min d itwaxeȓqen. <verse eid="COL 1:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="COL 1:16" />Zzayes netta iy zi d twaxeȓqent qaƹ ṯimesȓayin ig iǧan ḏeg ujenna niɣ ḏi ṯmurṯ. Waxxa tbanent-id niɣ war d tbinent ca. Niɣ ḏ lƹarcaṯ niɣ ḏ lmemlakaṯ niɣ ḏ yinni iḥekkmen niɣ ḏ yinni ijehḏen. Qaƹ ṯimesȓayin-a zzayes iy d twaxeȓqent, twaxeȓqent-as-d i netta. <verse eid="COL 1:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="COL 1:17" />Ḏ netta ig iǧan qbeȓ x ṯmesȓayin qaƹ u x dsas nnes iy tmunent qaƹ ṯimesȓayin. <verse eid="COL 1:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="COL 1:18" />Ḏ netta iy iǧan ḏ azeǧif n ddat iƹni n jmaƹeṯ n ȓmuminin. Ḏ netta ig iǧan ḏ amezwaru, ḏ netta ig iǧan ḏ amenzu zeg imettinen<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1.18 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Siḏiṯneɣ Ƹisa netta ifaq-d ḏ amezwaru zi marra yinni iy d ɣa ifaqen zeg imettinen war ḏewwiȓen ca aḏ mmṯen aɣarsen ṯiȓi ddat ḏ jḏiḏ n lƹaḍama. Xzar Ṯabrat ṯamezwarut ɣar Ayṯ-Kurinṯ, uḏem wis 15, lʼayaṯ 35-57.</char></note> bac ḏ netta iy ɣa yiȓin ḏ amezwaru ḏi ṯmesȓayin qaƹ. <verse eid="COL 1:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="COL 1:19" />Liʼanna iƹjeb-as i Arebbi aḏayes isezḏeɣ ḏi Mmis qaƹ min ɣares. <verse eid="COL 1:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="COL 1:20" />Ṯumma isemṣȓaḥ Arebbi qaƹ ṯimesȓayin i yixef nnes ig iǧan ḏi ṯmurṯ niɣ ḏeg ujenna iƹni igga ȓehna s iḏammen<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1.20 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Iḏammen netta ḏ ddem.</char></note> n Mmis iy yuzzȓen x ṣṣalib.<verse eid="COL 1:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="COL 1:21" />Kenniw tuɣa qbeȓ tiggwjem x Arebbi tmenɣam akiḏes s ȓaƹquȓaṯ nwem teggem ṯimesȓayin ḏ ṯiƹeffanin. <verse eid="COL 1:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="COL 1:22" />Walakin ȓexxu lla, Arebbi isemṣȓaḥ-ikenniw akiḏes s ddat n Lmasiḥ iƹni s ȓmewṯ nnes bac akenniw iqeddem zzaṯes ṯeṣfam bȓa ȓƹib war ḏinni bu wi kenniw iy ɣa itahamen. <verse eid="COL 1:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="COL 1:23" />Walakin labud aḏ teqqimem ḏi lʼiman nwem nican aḏ tbeddem x dsas, war ṯsemmḥem ca ḏi lʼamal n Lʼinjil tuɣa iy tesȓim. Lʼinjil-a twabeccarent zzayes qaƹ ṯimesȓayin itwaxeȓqen swadday ujenna, u nec Bulus ḏewȓeɣ ḏ axeddam nnes.<verse eid="COL 1:23" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ȓxeḏmeṯ n arrasul Bulus ḏi jmaƹeṯ n ȓmuminin</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="COL 1:24" />Ȓexxu nec farrḥeɣ x minxef tƹeddabeɣ ƹlaḥsab kenniw. Liʼanna ḏi ddat-a inu kessiɣ ȓḥaqq inu zi min ƹaḏ ineqqṣen zeg uƹeddeb nni n Lmasiḥ ƹlaḥsab ddat nnes iƹni jmaƹeṯ n ȓmuminin.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1.24 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ȓmaƹna n ljumla-ya iqseḥ cwayt bac at nefhem walakin ṯessawaȓ x uƹeddeb n ȓmuminin. Neccin aɣarneɣ yiȓi can n uƹeddeb am wenni iy xas ikkin x Lmasiḥ. Arrasul Bulus maṯalan ikka xas aṭṭas n uƹeddeb ḏi ȓeḥbes. Walakin netta min ma ikkin xas iggi-ṯ s ȓefraḥeṯ. </char></note> <verse eid="COL 1:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="COL 1:25" />Jmaƹeṯ-a ḏewȓeɣ ɣares nec ḏ ijjen n uxeddam nnes ƹlaḥsab lwajib nni zi Arebbi iy ḏayi d immucen bac akenniw beccareɣ s wawaȓ ikmaȓ n Arebbi. <verse eid="COL 1:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="COL 1:26" />Awaȓ-a netta ḏ ȓmaƹna nni iy tuɣa inuffaren ḏi zmanaṯ ḏ ljilaṯ iƹḏun, ȓexxu arrin-d xas ȓexbar ṣṣaliḥin. <verse eid="COL 1:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="COL 1:27" />Niṯni ixḍar-iṯen Arebbi bac aḏ xebbaren i yinni war iǧin ca zi Ayṯ-Israʼil aḏasen inin mecḥaȓ imɣar ȓxir-a lƹaḍim n ȓmaƹna inuffaren wanita. Min iƹna ȓmaƹna-ya? Lmasiḥ netta iǧa ḏaywem, ḏ lʼamal n lƹaḍama.<verse eid="COL 1:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="COL 1:28" />Lmasiḥ-a netbeccar zzayes i yiwḏan, nnehha-ṯen marra iḏsen, nseȓmaḏ-iṯen s marra ȓefhameṯ bac a nqeddem iwḏan marra ḏi Lmasiḥ bȓa ca n ȓƹib <char style="it">i Arebbi</char>. <verse eid="COL 1:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="COL 1:29" />X manaya nec xeddmeɣ, taḥȓeɣ ḏi ȓxeḏmeṯ-a s marra jjheḏ nni n Lmasiḥ netta isxeddam-ayi s ṯzemmar nnes.<verse eid="COL 1:29" /></para>
  <chapter eid="COL 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="COL 2" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="COL 2:1" />Cuf, xseɣ aḏ tessnem mecḥaȓ taḥȓeɣ <char style="it">ḏi ȓxeḏmeṯ-a</char> ƹlaḥsab kenniw ḏ yinni iǧan ḏi ṯendint n Lawdukya ḏ marra yinni ƹemmarṣ ma ẓȓin aɣembub inu. <verse eid="COL 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="COL 2:2" />Rezzuɣ uȓawen nwem aḏ twacejjƹen xmi ɣa munen ak wayawya s ȓemḥibbeṯ bac aḏ tawḍem ɣar marra ȓxir nni ig iǧan ḏeg yijjen n ȓefhameṯ ṯekmaȓ ḏ yijjen n ṯusna x ȓmaƹna inuffaren n Arebbi iǧan ḏi Lmasiḥ. <verse eid="COL 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="COL 2:3" />Ḏayes ḏi netta iy twasnuffaren marra ȓkunuz n ȓefhameṯ ḏ marra ȓkunuz n ṯusna.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">2.3 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ṯusna nettaṯ ḏ lmaƹrifa.</char></note> <verse eid="COL 2:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="COL 2:4" />Qqareɣ-awem manaya bac war d itis ḥadd akenniw icmeṯ s wawaȓ nnes aḏawem isneƹmiȓ ḏ ṣṣaḥ. <verse eid="COL 2:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="COL 2:5" />Nec waxxa war ǧiɣ ca akiḏwem s ddat inu aqayi akiḏwem s arruḥ inu, farrḥeɣ nec xmi twaȓiɣ lƹibada nwem nican teggem-t ṯa s ṯa u mecḥaȓ iy tbeddam ḏi lʼiman nwem ḏi Lmasiḥ.<verse eid="COL 2:5" /></para>
  <para style="s">Lḥurriya iy ɣarneɣ ḏi ṯuḏarṯ nneɣ ak Lmasiḥ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="COL 2:6" />Iḏen, mammec ṯqebȓem Ƹisa Lmasiḥ amenni iy ɣa ṯƹicem. <verse eid="COL 2:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="COL 2:7" />Itxeṣṣa-kenniw aḏ tiȓim ṯebnam x ḏsas nnes mliḥ, aḏ tiȓim ṯjehḏem ḏi lʼiman nwem mammec iy kenniw seȓmaḏen, aḏ tiȓim tenfeyyaḍem s ccuker.<verse eid="COL 2:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="COL 2:8" />Arrem-d ȓbaȓ nwem uȓa ḏ ijjen ma izemmar akenniw isxarweḍ s lfelsafa niɣ s uɣeddaȓ nni ixwan ƹlaḥsab ttaqalid n bnaḏem niɣ ƹlaḥsab lqawanin iqḏimen n ddunect-a qa maci ƹlaḥsab Lmasiḥ.<verse eid="COL 2:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="COL 2:9" />Liʼanna Lmasiḥ marra min iǧan n Arebbi izḏeɣ ḏi ddat nnes. <verse eid="COL 2:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="COL 2:10" />Kenniw ṯuḏarṯ nwem ṯekmaȓ ak Lmasiḥ iǧan netta ḏ azeǧif itrayyan x marra yinni iḥekkmen ḏ yinni ijehḏen. <verse eid="COL 2:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="COL 2:11" />Dayes ḏi netta ƹaweḏ iy ḏi ṯṭehharem walakin maci ḏ ijjen n ṭṭahareṯ iy ggin s ifassen n bnaḏem; Lla, ṯṭehharem ṭṭabiƹa nwem ṯaƹeffant qaƹ s yijjen n ṭṭahareṯ iggi-t Lmasiḥ.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">2.11 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Arrasul Bulus issawaȓ ḏanita x yijjen ṭṭahareṯ ɣar ḏaxeȓ nneɣ iƹni ḏi arruḥ nneɣ maci ḏ ijjen n ṭṭahareṯ ƹadi iy teggen iryazen ḏi ddat.</char></note> <verse eid="COL 2:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="COL 2:12" />Iƹni ṯenḍȓem akiḏes s ṭṭahareṯ nwem ḏeg waman, u ƹaweḏ s ṭṭahareṯ nwem ḏeg waman ṯekkarem-d akiḏes zi ȓmewṯ s lʼiman nwem ḏi ṯzemmar n Arebbi wenni d isekkaren Ƹisa zi ȓmewṯ.<verse eid="COL 2:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="COL 2:13" />Fa kenniw tuɣa ṯemmuṯem <char style="it">s wuȓawen nwem</char> ƹlaḥsab ȓmuƹṣiyaṯ ḏ ṭṭabiƹa nwem war iṭehharen ca, walakin Arebbi iseddar-d kenniw ak Lmasiḥ wami ḏaneɣ iɣfar qaƹ ȓmuƹṣiyaṯ nneɣ. <verse eid="COL 2:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="COL 2:14" />Imḥa amarwas nni ig izemmmen xaneɣ aqaṯ ḍed nneɣ s Lqanun. Manayenni iysi-ṯ iṣemmar-iṯ x ṣṣalib. <verse eid="COL 2:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="COL 2:15" />Arebbi ikkes ṯizemmar nni n yinni iḥekkmen ḏ yinni ijehḏen yarri-ṯen axasen furrjen iwḏan ifḍeḥ-iṯen irbeḥ-iṯen x ṣṣalib.<verse eid="COL 2:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="COL 2:16" />Iḏen war tejjam ḥadd akenniw iƹeyyeb x min tettem niɣ x min ṯsessem niɣ x ca n ȓeƹyuḏaṯ iy tiȓin kuȓ ƹam niɣ kuȓ char niɣ x nhar n ssebṯ n lƹibada. <verse eid="COL 2:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="COL 2:17" />Marra ṯimesȓayin-a niṯenti am ṯiȓi waha n ṯmesȓayin nni iy d ɣa yasen, ṯimesȓayin nni n ṣṣaḥ n Lmasiḥ. <verse eid="COL 2:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="COL 2:18" />War tejjam uȓa ḏ ijjen n bnaḏem akenniw isbeṭṭeȓ x ljaʼiza. Netta bnaḏem nni ḏ wenni ig isemɣaren min iqesḥen ḏi ddin, isemɣar ƹaweḏ lƹibada nni iy zi ƹebbḏen lmalaʼikaṯ. Issawaȓ aṭṭas ṯa s ṯa x min iẓra zaƹma ḏi ca n lwaḥi nnes. Ȓƹaqeȓ nnes yuff imɣar s ttakebbur. War ḏinni bu Arruḥ iqeddsen, ḏinni lʼafkar nnes ixwan waha. <verse eid="COL 2:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="COL 2:19" />Bnaḏem nni isexṣar lƹalaqa ak wenni itrayyan ḏ azeǧif. Azeǧif nni netta itḏebbar i ddat nnes amen-ṯekmaȓ wami nettaṯ ṯmun s ipurṣuṯen ḏ ȓemfaseȓ nnes bac ddat aḏ temɣar ƹlaḥsab min ixes Arebbi aḏ temɣar.<verse eid="COL 2:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="COL 2:20" />Kenniw meȓa ṯemmuṯem ak Lmasiḥ i lqawanin nni iqḏimen n ddunect-a, mayemmi ḏas teggem array i lqanun nni axmi ƹaḏ tƹicem zzayes ḏi ddunect-a? <verse eid="COL 2:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="COL 2:21" />Iƹni: "War kessi ca s ufus, war tqasa ca, war tḥaḏa ca." <verse eid="COL 2:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="COL 2:22" />Lqawanin-a yina ssawaȓen x can ṯmesȓayin iy ɣa ifnan xmi ɣa twaccent, niṯni ḏ lqawanin ḏ useȓmeḏ n yiwḏan waha. <verse eid="COL 2:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="COL 2:23" />Ḏ ṣṣaḥ, tɣiȓ-asen i yiwḏan lqawanin nni am ḏaysen ȓefhameṯ zaƹma x ssabab n lwajib n lƹibada nsen ḏ ddin nsen iqseḥ u ƹaweḏ mecḥaȓ tzeyyaren x ddat n bnaḏem. Walakin lqawanin-a war tƹiwinen uȓa ḏ ijjen n bnaḏem bac war itseƹƹif ca ccehawaṯ n ddat nnes.<verse eid="COL 2:23" /></para>
  <chapter eid="COL 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="COL 3" />
  <para style="s">Lqawanin n yijjen n ṯuḏarṯ ḏ jḏiḏ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="COL 3:1" />Iḏen fa wami twasnekkarem kenniw ak Lmasiḥ u labud aḏ terzum s wuȓawen nwem ṯimesȓayin nni iǧan ḏeg ujenna mani iqqim Lmasiḥ ɣar ufusi n Arebbi. <verse eid="COL 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="COL 3:2" />Rezzuṯ s wuȓawen nwem ṯimesȓayin nni iǧan ḏeg ujenna, maci ṯinni ḏi ṯmurṯ. <verse eid="COL 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="COL 3:3" />Minzi zaƹma kenniw ṯemmuṯem, ṯuḏarṯ nwem aqa ṯnuffar ak Lmasiḥ ḏi Arebbi. <verse eid="COL 3:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="COL 3:4" />Xmi d ɣa imeḍhar Lmasiḥ iƹni wenni iǧan ḏ ṯuḏarṯ nwem, ȓexddenni akiḏes tmeḍharem uȓa ḏ kenniw ḏi lƹaḍama.<verse eid="COL 3:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="COL 3:5" />X manaya nɣeṯ min iǧan ḏaywem ḏi ṭṭabiƹa nwem n ddunect-a iƹni lfasad ḏ min ixenzen ḏ ccehweṯ ḏ ȓxaḍar aƹeffan ḏ ṭṭmaƹ ig iǧan netta am lƹibada n lʼaṣnam. <verse eid="COL 3:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="COL 3:6" />Ƹlaḥsab ṯimesȓayin-a iy d ɣa yasen <char style="it">Nhar n</char> uɣḍab n Arebbi. <verse eid="COL 3:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="COL 3:7" />Tuɣa qbeȓ ṯuyurem x ibriḏen-a ṯƹicem ḏaysen. <verse eid="COL 3:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="COL 3:8" />Walakin ȓexxu ṯimesȓayin nni itxeṣṣa axawem ṯent ṯesbeƹƹḏem qaƹ iƹni aƹeṣṣab ḏ uɣḍab ḏ ccarr ḏ ȓbaṭeȓ ḏ wawaȓen iƹeffanen iy ṯeqqarem s uqemmum nwem. <verse eid="COL 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="COL 3:9" />War sxerriqem ca x wayawya ȓaḥeqqac ṯbeddȓem ṭṭabiƹa nni nwem tuɣa ɣarwem qbeȓ ḏayes ixarwiḍen waha. <verse eid="COL 3:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="COL 3:10" />Ȓexxu kenniw ṯeggim ijjen n ṭṭabiƹa nneɣni ḏ jḏiḏ ƹaḏ tḏewwaȓ-d ḏ jḏiḏ, ȓmaƹrifa nnes am ṣṣifeṯ n Lxaliq nnes. <verse eid="COL 3:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="COL 3:11" />War itɣimi bu uyunani niɣ ḏ aʼisraʼili, niɣ ḏ wenni iṭehharen niɣ ḏ wenni war iṭehhiren ca, niɣ ḏ abarbari niɣ ḏ aweḥciw,<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">3.11 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ḥarfiyan awaȓ-a aweḥciw netta ḏ asquṯi iƹni can iwḏan ḏ ihamajiyen tuɣa zeddɣen ɣar ccamal n Lyunan ḏ Lʼiran.</char></note> niɣ ḏ ismeɣ niɣ ḏ wenni iǧan ḥurr. Lla, Lmasiḥ netta ḏ marra, aqaṯ ḏi marra.<verse eid="COL 3:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="COL 3:12" />Iḏen kenniw ḏ ccaƹb muqeddes ixḍar-ikenniw Arebbi ṯƹizzem xas. Labud aḏaywem ṯiȓi lḥanana ḏ ȓxir ḏ ttawaḍuƹ ḏ ṣṣbar u marra bȓa ttakebbur. <verse eid="COL 3:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="COL 3:13" />Ṣbareṯ ak wayawya. Meȓa can yijjen zzaywem ɣares can lmuckil iy zzayes ɣa iceṯca x unneɣni, itxeṣṣa ijjen aḏ ismeḥ i unneɣni. Mammec ḏawem iɣfar Arebbi i kenniw, amenni iy ɣa ṯsemḥem i yiwḏan. <verse eid="COL 3:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="COL 3:14" />Ktar marra zi ṯmesȓayin-a ṯina itxeṣṣa aḏ tesxeḏmem ȓemḥibbeṯ jarawem minzi ȓemḥibbeṯ-a tas-d am yijjen n usɣun ig ismunen marra ṯimesȓayin-a ḏeg yicten.<verse eid="COL 3:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="COL 3:15" />Jjem ȓehna n Lmasiḥ aḏ iḥkem ḏeg wuȓawen nwem minzi kenniw ḏ ijjen n jmaƹeṯ iȓaɣa-yawem-d aȓ ȓehna-ya. Kenniw ƹaweḏ cekkarem Arebbi. <verse eid="COL 3:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="COL 3:16" />Jjem awaȓen n Lmasiḥ aḏaywem zeḏɣen s marra lbaraka nsen. S marra ȓefhameṯ itxeṣṣa ijjen aḏ isefhem unneɣni, ijjen aḏ inha unneɣni. Ɣennjem s wawaȓen n Zzabur ḏ lʼamdaḥ ḏ yizȓan ruḥiya akiḏes ṯeggem ijjen n ccuker ḏeg wuȓawen nwem i Arebbi. <verse eid="COL 3:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="COL 3:17" />Marra min teggem s wawaȓen niɣ s lḥasanaṯ, itxeṣṣa aḏ teggem manaya marra ƹlaḥsab isem n Siḏiṯneɣ Ƹisa azzayes tcekkarem Arebbi Babaṯneɣ.<verse eid="COL 3:17" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ȓuṣiyaṯ n ȓmuminin itḏeffaren Lmasiḥ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="COL 3:18" />A ṯimɣarin, ṭaƹent i iryazen nkent minzi manaya ig iǧan ḏ lmaƹqul zi Arebbi.<verse eid="COL 3:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="COL 3:19" />Ay iryazen, ḥibbem ṯimɣarin nwem war iǧi aḏkisent twaqsḥem.<verse eid="COL 3:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="COL 3:20" />Ay iḥenjiren, ṭaƹem i lwalidin nwem ḏi marra ṯimesȓayin minzi manaya itƹejib-as i Siḏi Arebbi.<verse eid="COL 3:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="COL 3:21" />Ay ibabaṯen, war tqehharem ca ṯarwa nwem bac war tefciȓen ca.<verse eid="COL 3:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="COL 3:22" />Ay isemɣan, ṭaƹeṯ i ayṯbab nwem n ddunect-a ḏi marra ṯimesȓayin. Ṭaƹem-asen maci ɣir xmi ḏawem tbeddan ɣar uzeǧif waha ḥima aḏasen ṯƹejbem; Lla, ṭaƹem-asen s ȓxaḍar nwem akiḏwem ṯiȓi ijjen n ṯiggwḏi ḏi Siḏiṯneɣ. <verse eid="COL 3:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="COL 3:23" />Marra min teggem, teggem-ṯ s ȓxaḍar nwem mammec ḏas ṯxeddmem i Siḏiṯneɣ maci i iryazen. <verse eid="COL 3:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="COL 3:24" />Kenniw ṯessnem ljaʼiza nwem aḏ tiȓi ḏ ijjen n lwareṯ zi Siḏiṯneɣ. Netta umi ṯxeddmem netta ḏ Siḏiṯneɣ Lmasiḥ. <verse eid="COL 3:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="COL 3:25" />Cuf, wenni iḍeǧmen ataf aḏ icc aƹmuḏ x min iḍeǧem. <char style="it">Arebbi</char> war itegg bu s wuḏemawen jar yiwḏan.<verse eid="COL 3:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="COL 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="COL 4" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="COL 4:1" />Ay ayṯbab n isemɣan, ḏebbarem xasen x isemɣan nwem s min iǧan nican ḏ ȓḥaqq nsen aqa kenniw ṯessnem illa ɣarwem Bab nwem ḏeg ujenna.<verse eid="COL 4:1" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ȓuṣiyaṯ ṯineggura</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="COL 4:2" />Teggem lmejhud s ṯẓaǧiṯ nwem, iȓim ƹlabal ḏi ṯẓaǧit nwem cekkarem Arebbi. <verse eid="COL 4:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="COL 4:3" />Ḏi nnefs n ȓweqṯ ttarem-as i Arebbi xaneɣ bac aḏ irzem ṯawwarṯ i wawaȓ nneɣ a nbeccar s ȓmaƹna inuffaren n Lmasiḥ iy xef iy ǧiɣ nec ḏi ȓeḥbes. <verse eid="COL 4:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="COL 4:4" />Ttarem-as i Arebbi bac azzayes sfehmeɣ mliḥ <char style="it">i yiwḏan</char> ƹlaḥsab min labud aḏ iniɣ. <verse eid="COL 4:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="COL 4:5" />Ƹiceṯ s ȓefhameṯ ak yinni iǧan ɣar barra nwem <char style="it">war yuminen ca</char>, staɣellam ȓweqṯ nwem mliḥ. <verse eid="COL 4:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="COL 4:6" />U labud awaȓ nwem aḏ yiȓi ȓebda iccur s arḍa imeǧḥen s ȓemȓeḥ bac aḏ tessnem mamc ɣa ṯarrem x kur ijjen.<verse eid="COL 4:6" /></para>
  <para style="s">Lxitam n ṯebrat-a</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="COL 4:7" />Umaṯneɣ Tuciq akenniw ixebbar x marra min teggeɣ ḏanita. Netta iƹizz xafi, itsexxar i Arebbi s yijjen n ttiqeṯ. Netta ḏ axeddam itemƹacaren akiḏi ḏi ȓxeḏmeṯ n Siḏiṯneɣ. <verse eid="COL 4:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="COL 4:8" />Ssekkeɣ-ṯ-iḏ ɣarwem x ccɣeȓ-a wanita bac aḏ tessnem mamc neǧa neccin aḏ icejjeƹ uȓawen nwem. <verse eid="COL 4:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="COL 4:9" />Akiḏes umaṯneɣ Wanisamu netta iy xaneɣ iƹizzen ḏayes ttiqeṯ, netta zi ṯmurṯ nwem. Yina akenniw xebbaren marra min iweqƹen ḏeg umcan-a.<verse eid="COL 4:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="COL 4:10" />Isawwaḍ-awem-d sȓam Aristarxus wenni iy kiḏi iǧan ḏi ȓeḥbes-a. Isawwaḍ-awem-d sȓam uȓa ḏ Marqus mmis n ƹzizes n Barnabas. Tuɣa weṣṣiɣ-kenniw x Marqus-a, meȓa yusa-d ɣarwem reḥḥbeṯ zzayes. <verse eid="COL 4:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="COL 4:11" />Isawwaḍ-awem-d sȓam ƹaweḏ Ƹisa wenni umi qqaren Yustus. Ḏ yina waha ig iǧan ḏ israʼiliyen zeg yinni itemƹacaren akiḏi ḏi ȓxeḏmeṯ-a ƹlaḥsab ȓmulk n Arebbi, tcejjaƹen-ayi aṭṭas.<verse eid="COL 4:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="COL 4:12" />Isawwaḍ-awem-d sȓam Pafras netta ig iǧan zi ṯmurṯ nwem, netta ḏ ijjen n uxeddam n Ƹisa Lmasiḥ. Ȓebda itaḥeȓ ḏi ṯẓaǧiṯ ƹlaḥsab kenniw bac aḏ tbeddem x dsas aḏ tiȓim ṯemɣarem ḏi lʼiman nwem war ɣarwem itȓi bu ccekk ḏi marra min ixes Arebbi. <verse eid="COL 4:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="COL 4:13" />Nec cehhḏeɣ xas irebbeȓ xawem mliḥ ḏ yinni ƹaweḏ iǧan ḏi ṯendint n Lawdukya ḏ yinni iǧan ḏi ṯendint n Yirapulis.<verse eid="COL 4:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="COL 4:14" />Isawwaḍ-awem-d sȓam amƹizz nneɣ Luqa ig iǧan ḏ aḍbib, akiḏes Dimas. <verse eid="COL 4:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="COL 4:15" />Siwḍem-asen sȓam inu i ayṯmaṯneɣ iy iǧan ḏi ṯendint n Lawdukya ḏ <char style="it">wučmaṯneɣ</char> Numibya ḏ jmaƹeṯ n ȓmuminin iy iǧan ḏi ṯeddarṯ nnes.<verse eid="COL 4:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="COL 4:16" />Xmi ɣa ṯɣarem ṯabrat-a kenniw jarawem, ƹaweḏ xzarem jmaƹeṯ n ȓmuminin at ɣaren ḏi Lawdukya. Xzarem ƹaweḏ kenniw ṯabrat nsen zi Lawdukya at tɣarem.<verse eid="COL 4:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="COL 4:17" />Inim-as i Arkippus u labud aḏ tkemmȓeḏ lwajib n ȓxeḏmeṯ iy ṯqebȓeḏ zi Siḏiṯneɣ.<verse eid="COL 4:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="COL 4:18" />Qa nec ḏ Bulus s ṯira n ufus inu iy zi ḏawem d sawwaḍeɣ sȓam ȓexxu. Feqḏem-ayi-d s snaseȓ inu <char style="it">n ȓeḥbes-a</char>. Akiḏwem yiȓi arḍa.<verse eid="COL 4:18" /></para>
  <chapter eid="COL 4" />
</usx>